<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P affirms NTT AAA long-term rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms NTT AAA long-term rating.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday that it affirmed Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp's (NTT) AAA long-term and A-1+ short-term ratings.</p>
<p>NTT's ratings outlook remains negative, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
